    "architecturalHeights": "Retained exact-QID way/8093737/Q1050668 matches current main35184380182569 (16 vertices rather than earlier26). Whole and five component controls retain all56 current vertices/tags rigidly with no rescale. Main envelope height26m, two tower parts92m, nave/cross40m and dome70m remain verbatim. Existing Wikidata height92m/length111m/width46m facts are preserved; measurement datums/scope are unspecified. Mapped whole about111.5m long/46.1m wide agrees closely. Native+X north-northeast twin-tower/rose front versus-X faceted southern apse signs retained heading1.153725362049rad. Map heights are interpreted as overall cap/ridge/tip levels above an estimated floor, not measured eaves or independent vertical surveys. Modeled tower crosses92m, nave/cross ridge40m, dome/lantern cross70m and lower aisle roof26m preserve those controls. Picture estimates subdivide these into aisle walls19m, nave/cross walls30m, front central wall32m/gable40m, tower lower32m/upper62m, steep spires89m/crosses92m; drum40..48m, green dome65m/lantern68.5m/cross70m. Portal/rose proportions, side/rear window rhythm, buttresses/pinnacles, flying arches, roof contours, small chapels and lantern details are estimates. No survey/engineering accuracy claimed."
